WEBVTT

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.160
Father will surely be pleased as well.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.400
Don't get me wrong.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:15.080
I think the Alice Game should be
fought one on one.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:19.410
I have no intention of joining you
or Shinku's group.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.820
I just wanted to make that clear.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:23.860
Bye.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:32.020
I will choose the method
that is certain to succeed.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:35.860
In order to obtain all 
of the Rosa Mysticas.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.370
The Admonition

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:49.110
If it's Souseiseki, she apparently
wants to check something...

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.610
...so she left, saying 
she'd be away for a while.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.800
You hadn't heard about 
this from Souseiseki?

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.850
Uh, w-well...

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.720
Yes! I remember her saying 
something like that!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.130
Matsu was sad to see her go though.

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:10.560
I-I'm sure she'll be 
back before you know it.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:14.000
Besides, Suiseiseki will come by
regularly to have tea.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:17.900
That's what Souseiseki said too.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:23.420
That you were sure to come visit us.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:27.810
I appreciate you showing concern
for us old fogies.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.650
Souseiseki is...

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.400
so unfair.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.330
Making promises to Gramps
without my knowing.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.300
And leaving by herself 
without my knowing...

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:51.670
Suiseiseki has always wanted to be
together with Souseiseki.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:59.940
Did you not feel the 
same way, Souseiseki?

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.060
I had no idea...

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.930
It cannot be helped.

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:08.950
Souseiseki has her own thoughts
on the matter after all.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.410
It can't be helped? That's...

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.970
It makes me worried for Suiseiseki-chan.

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:23.470
You know, Suiseiseki was
crying lots last night too.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:27.680
Enough to make a pond with her tears...
Crying lots and lots!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.870
You're a crybaby, I guess?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.080
Y-You are too!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.750
She's back!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.600
Welcome home, Suiseiseki-chan.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.190
Home!

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:27.400
Oh, shall we watch some TV?

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.160
Y-Yeah!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.800
One, two... Beep.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.540
Man, this is fantastic!

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:38.480
Oh, nagashi somen.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.010
It's summer all right.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.180
Nagashi somen?

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.010
It looks kind of fun.

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:45.450
I know!

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.180
Shall we have nagashi somen for lunch?

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:53.120
But... we don't even have 
the equipment for it.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.980
N-Nagashi somen it is!

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:12.300
Yay!

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.440
Then, Jun-kun, I'll leave 
the equipment to you.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.350
What do you think, Shinku-chan?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:33.420
The noodles are firm, and the aroma
of the bonito is excellent.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:35.360
And above all, there's an elegant charm.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.510
It's a huge success!

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:39.940
I'm the one that had to 
work the hardest here.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:41.370
I scrounged for the plastic bottles...

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.140
Okay, I'm gonna keep 
sending noodles down.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:46.510
I hope you'll eat lots too, Suiseiseki.

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.060
Hey, what about the work I did?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:52.360
Here goes, Suiseiseki!

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:54.750
There!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:08.250
Oh, i-it's all right.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:11.090
We can pick up the noodles that fell
and send them down again.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.880
Come on, there's more coming!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.990
What the heck is this?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.210
A cookie?

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:23.610
Next up is hard candy!

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:26.350
Suiseiseki, it's round and tasty!

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.700
Nope, it's going to be
sweet egg omelet, I guess?

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:33.120
Suiseiseki will think it's 
scrumptious, I guess?

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.330
Quit it!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.990
Don't send weird things down!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.490
You guys are always doing this!
 Give it a rest!

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.720
Hey, hold it!

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.830
Cookies and egg omelets aren't things
you should send down!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:48.000
Besides, they both taste better
when you eat them straight up!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.330
Why do you have to send them down?

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:51.660
You aren't going to eat?

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.380
It's quite delicious.

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:57.110
I cannot summon an appetite 
at a time like this...

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.700
I've got you cornered now!

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.990
Give it up, you two!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:07.810
Why you...

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:09.440
Nori!

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.900
Sis, don't protect them!

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:13.620
Now, now.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.890
Just as Souseiseki is precious to you...

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.880
...to everyone, you are...

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:24.580
Shinku...

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:27.210
I won't say to force yourself...

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.640
...but you should eat precisely
because it is a time like this.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:40.670
Okay, here comes the next one.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:41.880
Oh?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.620
A pink one...

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.970
Oh! These are hiyamugi, not somen!

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:51.300
They weren't nagashi somen?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.610
I feel betrayed, I guess?

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:56.360
It doesn't make a big difference
either way, does it?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.140
I'm sorry.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.870
But hiyamugi are tasty too.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:07.080
Ah, how delicious!

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.610
The pink noodle tastes like strawberry.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.150
Oh! Strawberry flavored!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.650
N-Nori, give Hina a pink one too!

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.250
One for Kana too, I guess?

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:18.780
Oh, dear.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.920
There's only one pink one.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.900
What?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.380
And it is not even 9 o'clock yet...

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:47.380
He must be really tired.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:01.300
S-Suiseiseki...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.120
Suiseiseki is sleepy too.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.970
You hurry up and get yourself
to bed too, puny Ichigo.

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.970
Good night, you.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.380
Good night.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.020
Suigintou?

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:50.470
What is it?

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.480
What's the matter, Shinku?

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:13.720
Oh!

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:17.890
The bright red roof
on that house was so cute too...

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:20.730
This is the N Field.

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.530
That is not right!

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:27.050
How could the N Field be
directly outside the window?

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:28.740
The only one capable of this is...

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.310
Oh! Shinku, look!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.430
Suigintou.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.620
Bara-Suishou?

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.020
So you two are in on this together!

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:51.020
And what will you do if we are?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:52.910
We will do nothing.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.240
That's right!
 We'll do noth...

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:57.920
I will say this now.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.260
I...

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:02.370
...have no intention 
of fighting you two.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:08.010
After coming this far, you still play
goody two-shoes, Shinku?

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.780
That kind of attitude 
just makes my skin crawl!

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.580
W-What are you playing at?

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.110
I will not fight.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:38.050
I have no intention of criticizing
your way of thinking.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:38.900
But...

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.740
I have no intention of changing
my way of thinking either.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:45.740
In that case...

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:49.610
I shall change it for you.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.720
Shinku!

00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:59.560
Puny Ichigo!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.460
And what will you do?

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:10.200
Hand over your Rosa 
Mystica without a fight?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:11.870
Or...

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.040
A-As if I'd give it to you!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:17.140
Then... it's settled!

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.720
Souseiseki!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.260
I see.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.960
So you've come as well.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.180
Yeah.

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:37.960
Souseiseki!

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:40.650
This is my fight.

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.160
I want you to stay out of it.

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:53.810
W-Wait, you!

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.670
Souseiseki...

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:21.220
Souseiseki, what is it that you seek
from the Alice Game?

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.240
What Father desires.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:27.860
I am asking about what 
you think yourself.

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:30.480
Father's desire...

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.580
...is my desire!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.110
This is...

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.200
Hina-Ichigo!

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.360
Souseiseki!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.210
Suiseiseki, you...

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:46.920
Your shears exist to protect people's
hearts and minds!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.180
It is not fitting for you
to hurt someone with them!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:54.920
Come back with Suiseiseki 
this very instant!

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:56.430
But...

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.200
Father...

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:00.240
Souseiseki!

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.140
Found you.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.880
Now, let us continue.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.760
Stop this, you!

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:23.620
Suiseiseki!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:27.620
Please, Suigintou! No more!

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.380
You're awfully overprotective,
aren't you, Suiseiseki?

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:33.600
But...

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:37.150
It doesn't look like your
younger sister welcomes it.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:41.200
S-Souseiseki...

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:46.910
If Father is yearning for Alice,
I want to respond to that call.

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:50.060
Get back.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:52.250
I do not want to!

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:54.250
Suiseiseki...

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.260
I do not want to!

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:10.360
If I can just be together with you,
that is all I care about!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:14.410
I don't care if I can't become Alice!

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.370
Suiseiseki...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.200
I love Father of course...

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:24.430
But if it means losing you...

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:28.780
If you...

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:31.350
If you want to do this even so...

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.060
...you cut Suiseiseki down!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.590
I'm sorry.

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:44.330
I can't turn back now.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:53.710
Suiseiseki, if you mean to interfere...

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.910
...I will cut you off!

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:02.540
No!

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:24.870
Souseiseki.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:37.620
S-Souseiseki...

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.180
<i>A perfect girl...</i>

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:44.690
<i>If her existence is the only thing
that will ease Father's sorrow...</i>

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.760
I want to give that to him!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.960
Souseiseki!

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.000
Souseiseki!

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.630
Souseiseki, hang in there, you!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.980
Souseiseki!

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:41.370
Are you crying again?

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.020
Y-Yes, I am.

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.520
You're a wretched younger sister!

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.620
So you cannot ignore Father's sorrow...

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.760
...but you have no problem
making your elder sister cry?

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:04.270
Suiseiseki, you have the strength
to go on alone...

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:07.020
You already have it.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.270
Souseiseki.

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:13.710
You're coming back together
with me, Souseiseki!

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:16.420
Together?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.750
Together!

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:29.760
Suiseiseki, t-take...

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:32.100
...my Rosa Mystica...

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:35.460
S-Souseiseki...

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:48.980
Souseiseki!

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:02.720
So that is...

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.460
...a Rosa Mystica.

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:45.860
Souseiseki, is this 
what the Alice Game is?

00:23:46.240 --> 00:23:48.690
Is this what Father desires?

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:50.160
I do not know.

00:23:50.340 --> 00:23:53.000
But it has all begun now.

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:54.880
We can no longer stop it.

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:56.140
This can't be...

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:57.900
What is...

00:23:57.900 --> 00:24:00.270
What is Suiseiseki supposed to do?

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:04.040
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:06.840
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:04.470 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 10
Tomoe
